{"id":"n60303-1-7","stage":2,"title":"비틀거리다 · 趔趔趄趄","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n60303-1-7-1","ko":"짐이 많아 비틀거리는 것 같은데 내가 좀 들어 줄까?","zh":"你看起来好像因为东西太多而走不稳，要我帮你拿一点吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"짐이","meaning":"担子","explanation":"짐：担子；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"짐","audio":"/audio/3d95bbb883f1e7513260.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71357","senseId":"2","lemma":"짐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"많아","meaning":"多，丰富，强","explanation":"많다：多，丰富，强；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"많다","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69295","senseId":"1","lemma":"많다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"비틀거리는","meaning":"趔趔趄趄，踉踉跄跄，跌跌撞撞","explanation":"비틀거리다：趔趔趄趄，踉踉跄跄，跌跌撞撞；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"비틀거리다","audio":"/audio/83e6a143a4292cf65d17.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60303","senseId":"1","lemma":"비틀거리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"같은데","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；은데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"내가","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"들어","meaning":"带，提，拎","explanation":"들다：带，提，拎；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"들다","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57293","senseId":"1","lemma":"들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"줄까?","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；ㄹ까：非敬语地提出建议、自问或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"3d95bbb883f1e751","term":"짐","zh":"担子","audio":"/audio/3d95bbb883f1e7513260.mp3","entryId":"71357","definition":"承担的责任或负担。","pronunciation":["짐"]},{"id":"b30b4bf6ab97d6a5","term":"많다","zh":"多，丰富，强","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3","entryId":"69295","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准。","pronunciation":["만ː타"]},{"id":"83e6a143a4292cf6","term":"비틀거리다","zh":"趔趔趄趄，踉踉跄跄，跌跌撞撞","audio":"/audio/83e6a143a4292cf65d17.mp3","entryId":"60303","definition":"支撑不住身体，不停地到处摇晃，像要摔倒似地走。","pronunciation":["비틀거리다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"7ff37822e89462ea","term":"들다","zh":"带，提，拎","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3","entryId":"57293","definition":"手里拿着。","pronunciation":["들다"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"77245","definition":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","pronunciation":["주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/758f02652a4bc7a52131.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n60303-1-7-2","ko":"응, 고마워.","zh":"嗯，谢谢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"고마워.","meaning":"感谢，感激","explanation":"고맙다：感谢，感激；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"고맙다","audio":"/audio/ded2b4943e89f57dd33d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20041","senseId":"1","lemma":"고맙다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"ded2b4943e89f57d","term":"고맙다","zh":"感谢，感激","audio":"/audio/ded2b4943e89f57dd33d.mp3","entryId":"20041","definition":"因别人为自己做了什么，内心感到很满足，并想给予回报。","pronunciation":["고ː맙따"]}],"audio":"/audio/1975e32c89be5f2423ec.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.487,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=60303","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":83,"sequenceScore":2.3137,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["嗯，谢谢。","你看起来好像因为东西太多而走不稳，要我帮你拿一点吗？","你希望遇到什么样的男朋友呢？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你看起来好像因为东西太多而走不稳，要我帮你拿一点吗？","你希望遇到什么样的男朋友呢？","嗯，谢谢。"],"answer":2}]}
